      "content": "Here is a sample response that balances empathy with professional credibility to maximize your sentiment score:\n\n\"Thank you for bringing this important feedback to our attention; we truly value your experience and are committed to creating a positive culture for everyone at Vanguard. Please know that we have personally reviewed your concerns and are currently working on a concrete plan to address these issues and improve your future interactions with us. We appreciate your patience and would love the opportunity to discuss this further with you directly.\"",
